            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Cloudflare outage hits OpenAI, the mega paint merger worth $17B",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> takes a closer look at the stories behind some of the trending tickers on Yahoo Finance's platform.</p>\n<p>A Cloudflare (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NET\">NET</a>) outage hits several sites, including OpenAI's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>) ChatGPT and Elon Musk's X.</p>\n<p>Redburn analysts downgrade Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) and Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>), raising AI concerns.</p>\n<p>Akzo Nobel (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AKUP.SG\">AKUP.SG</a>) and Axalta Coating Systems (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AXTA\">AXTA</a>) are merging to form a $17 billion paint giant.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
